From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:26:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: apple: fit the J120 charger and gauge bindings
 to main

The D2355's PMU events are a gpio child with apple,d2355-pmic-gpio, as
in the shared Apple PMIC event controller binding, so the PMIC binding
needs no separate events child. The J120 BQ27540 compatible is already
described in ti,bq27545-hdq.yaml; drop the second schema for it.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,pmic.yaml   |  3 --
 .../power/supply/apple,j120-bq27540.yaml      | 38 -------------------
 2 files changed, 41 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/apple,j120-bq27540.yaml

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,pmic.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,pmic.yaml
index 5ec317d11..a687c5218 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,pmic.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,pmic.yaml
@@ -63,9 +63,6 @@ properties:
   gpio:
     $ref: /schemas/gpio/apple,d2365-pmic-gpio.yaml
 
-  events:
-    $ref: /schemas/interrupt-controller/apple,pmic-events.yaml
-
   cover-switch:
     type: object
     description: Magnetic cover switch wired to GPIOs 0 and 10 on the J120 August PMIC.
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/apple,j120-bq27540.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/apple,j120-bq27540.yaml
deleted file mode 100644
index c311167ea..000000000
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/apple,j120-bq27540.yaml
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,38 +0,0 @@
-# SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0-only OR BSD-2-Clause)
-%YAML 1.2
----
-$id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/power/supply/apple,j120-bq27540.yaml#
-$schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
-
-title: Apple J120 BQ27540 HDQ fuel gauge
-
-maintainers:
-  - tompta1 <546706+tompta1@users.noreply.github.com>
-
-description: |
-  The J120 battery gauge uses HDQ and the BQ27541 register layout. Its
-  telemetry profile uses RemainingCapacity rather than NominalAvailableCapacity.
-  It is a child of an HDQ bus, not an I2C device.
-
-properties:
-  compatible:
-    items:
-      - const: apple,j120-bq27540
-      - const: ti,bq27540-hdq
-
-  monitored-battery:
-    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/phandle
-    description: Battery characteristics, if independently known.
-
-required:
-  - compatible
-
-additionalProperties: false
-
-examples:
-  - |
-    hdq {
-        fuel-gauge {
-            compatible = "apple,j120-bq27540", "ti,bq27540-hdq";
-        };
-    };
